Research / portfolio project — for non-commercial academic use.

This repository contains original analysis code and documentation.
It builds on the LibEER framework (https://github.com/XJTU-EEG/LibEER)
and the SEED dataset (BCMI Lab, Shanghai Jiao Tong University).

The SEED dataset is subject to its own license (academic, non-commercial);
users must request access from BCMI Lab directly. No SEED data is included
in this repository.
